 résidences à travers le monde. Il s'engage par un bail commercial, assurant le versement de vos loyers, que le logement soit occupé ou non.\n3. ContactPour toute information complémentaire, veuillez contacter Acumen Patrimoine :\nTéléphone : 01 41 55 12 20\n\nEmail : info@acumenpatrimoine.fr","addr":"21 Grande Rue","gal":["https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjQ3MTNjOWNiODljMDc3OWYxODhjNWI2MWU0OWVlZDY0NDNjMGFhNDUiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiJhOWVhMDBkMTRjMDUwYWZlZmRlN2RjM2RmYWExMGU2MiJ9?signature=73e01e5d415f248b4a135328d27eb13217e5de43027765c695331b7a2a0e3059","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjE4Y2Q0MGMxZDlkMmU2M2QxOGNhMGEzN2I3MTI3ZTQwODcyYTk4MTgiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiJkMGVkYWUzMDE2MjU2YWM3ZGZjZmZhMDQ4OGIzYmYzOCJ9?signature=defd4725a43dafd95298f218e21065f76188c33b588d1a664ee3374eed4cc266","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6ImUxZGU1OGUyNzBjMTBkYjFjMmQ0ZDZlYzI0ZWMwNTZhZjVmMTk0MWYiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiI3YjMyNzQyOTVlODZiMTkzOWU4MTBhMDc2Mzk3ODQwOSJ9?signature=c5a7da31ea5211cda0170a746bd04183d81206f69545ed0f80a78c9986f2ab86","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjIyZjkwNTA5Y2IzNDBlMGRmOTViNGY5MzY5ZDg1OWQzYTNkZWVmYWQiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiJiYzc5NTNhZjk5MmRjOGU0MmY1MGM2NWMxZjY5ZDQzYiJ9?signature=80fddc1d1cba95d95a1d902506d8a54ef3a421983d2b1ba7c2c2cab231521037","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjMxNGU5YTdhNjkxMDc1ZGMyOTY2OGRiMjBmNDM4MjA3MDE1ZmFkNmUiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwM